  "solution": {
    "text": "Given:<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>W</mi></math></p><p>Then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math><br />Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>On comparing, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>and,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>e</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
